    <Title>Deploy &quot;Lotus Notes 8.5.2&quot; Files - Installation Command: &quot;setup.exe&quot; /s /V&quot;/qn&quot;</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[This task will download 45 files from the "Lotus Notes 8.5.2" Software Distribution Package onto selected endpoints <BR><BR><B>Installation Command:</B> "setup.exe" /s /V"/qn"<BR><BR><B>Run Command As:</B> System User<BR><BR><B>Download Size:</B> 420,729.4 KB ]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system AND (if( name of operating system starts with &quot;Win&quot; ) then platform id of operating system != 3 else true)</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[/* Relevance generated from file "Lotus Notes 8.5.2.msi" */ (exists file "msiexec.exe" of system folder) AND (disjunction of (NOT exists keys "{07C69B3A-62B3-41BF-82EE-B3A87BD6EA0C}" whose ( value "DisplayVersion" of it as string as version >= "8.52.10222" as version AND value "Language" of it as string = "0") of keys "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall" of ( x32 registry; (if exists x64 registry then x64 registry else nothing) )))]]></Relevance>
